error-loc-tag-invalid = That language isn't recognised.
error-loc-not-offered = Your company doesn't offer that language.
error-loc-catalogue-missing = That language isn't available in this version.
error-loc-store-unavailable = Your language choice couldn't be saved.
error-loc-languages-unavailable = Languages can't be changed here.
error-loc-language-not-editable = English (UK) is ordin's own wording and can't be changed.
error-loc-language-unknown = That language isn't on this computer.
error-loc-message-unknown = That message doesn't exist in this version.
error-loc-message-refused = “{ $message }” wasn't saved: { $problem }
error-loc-not-shipped = Only a language that comes with ordin can be restored.
error-loc-file-unreadable = That file isn't an ordin language file.
error-loc-file-too-large = That file is too large to be a language file.
error-loc-language-exists = You already have that language. Choose Replace to use the new file.
error-loc-language-drafting = Ordin is still drafting that language.
