error-loc-language-not-confirmed = Review that language and choose Use this language first.
error-loc-language-active = Choose another language before removing this one.
error-loc-too-many-languages = You have 20 languages of your own, the most ordin keeps.
error-srv-internal = ordin couldn't finish that. Try again in a moment; if it happens again, tell IT what you were doing.
error-svc-internal = Something went wrong inside ordin.
error-push-copy-linked = This file is published from its linked folder. Send it again from the folder's Ready to publish list.
error-brand-asset-unknown = That brand file doesn't exist.
error-brand-store-unavailable = ordin couldn't load its appearance.

# Errors a person can meet on first start and while adding or removing a link (ScreensModule SM-FS, SM-AW, SM-RL).
error-svc-deadline = That took too long, so ordin stopped waiting. Try again.
error-setup-sign-in-timeout = The sign-in wasn't finished in time. Try again, and finish signing in in your browser.
error-setup-no-harness-access = You don't have Claude access yet. Ask IT to give you access.
error-setup-harness-missing = Claude Code isn't installed on this computer. Ask IT to install it.
error-setup-harness-untested = This version of Claude Code hasn't been checked with ordin yet. Ask IT to install a checked version.
error-setup-harness-unknown = ordin can't sign you in to that assistant. Ask IT which one your company uses.
error-setup-harness-check-failed = Claude Code couldn't be checked. Try again.
error-setup-no-ready-harness = ordin needs Claude Code, signed in, before it can start. Sign in, or ask IT for access.
error-setup-sign-in-on-server = Sign in on the computer where this ordin runs, not from here.
error-setup-no-profile-address = ordin can't find your company's settings. Ask IT to send them.
error-setup-profile-unreachable = Your company's settings can't be reached just now. ordin goes on with the last ones it has.
error-setup-catalogue-failed = The company's agent library can't be reached just now. Try again in a moment.
error-setup-agent-folder-failed = Your agents' folders couldn't be prepared. Try again.
error-setup-program-refused = This computer stopped a program ordin needs. Ask IT to allow it.
error-setup-program-damaged = A program ordin needs is damaged. Ask IT to reinstall ordin.
error-setup-program-failed = A program ordin needs couldn't be set up. Try again.
error-setup-craft-app-failed = One of the company's apps couldn't be set up. Try again.
error-setup-store-failed = ordin couldn't save its set-up on this computer. Try again.
error-sp-sign-in-needed = Sign in to SharePoint so ordin can reach it.
error-sp-access-denied = You don't have access to that in SharePoint. Ask its owner for access.
error-sp-not-found = That SharePoint place can't be found. It may have been moved or deleted.
error-sp-unavailable = SharePoint can't be reached just now. Try again in a moment.
error-sp-throttled = SharePoint is busy just now. Try again in a moment.
error-sp-not-configured = SharePoint isn't set up for your company yet. Ask IT to set it up.
error-sp-query-invalid = Type at least two letters to search.
error-conf-sign-in-needed = Sign in to Confluence so ordin can reach it.
error-conf-access-denied = You don't have access to that in Confluence. Ask the space's owner for access.
error-conf-not-found = That Confluence page or space can't be found. It may have been moved or deleted.
error-conf-unavailable = Confluence can't be reached just now. Try again in a moment.
error-conf-throttled = Confluence is busy just now. Try again in a moment.
error-conf-not-configured = Confluence isn't set up on this computer yet. Add it in Settings.
error-conf-query-invalid = Type at least two letters to search.
error-src-duplicate = That's already linked to this workspace.
error-ws-not-a-repository = That folder doesn't hold a code repository. Choose the folder that has the code in it.
error-ws-place-refused = That folder is protected, so ordin can't use it. Choose another folder.
error-ws-local-folder-on-server = A folder on your computer can't be added to a workspace kept on another computer.
error-ws-source-sign-in-needed = Sign in first so ordin can reach it.
error-ws-source-not-configured = That isn't set up on this computer yet. Add it in Settings.
error-ws-source-access-denied = You don't have access to that. Ask its owner for access.
error-ws-source-not-found = That can't be found. It may have been moved or deleted.
error-ws-source-unavailable = That can't be reached just now. Try again in a moment.
error-ws-link-not-found = That link is no longer in this workspace.
error-ws-not-active = This workspace is in the Bin. Restore it first.
error-ws-confluence-unavailable = Confluence couldn't be added to this workspace. Try again in a moment.
